Hello,

Currently the twitter feed on the LMW front page is just a regular=20
twitter search, and thus contains whatever is newest, which often is=20
languages which the visitor might not know.

To solve this I wrote a small utility called bano[0], which uses the=20
Twitter Search API's language search functionality to generate language=20
specific feeds, to be run at some set interval as eg, a cronjob

Of cours, there isn't activity on twitter for all languages available on=20
the LMW, so on the pages that there isn't activity for it might be best=20
to either fall back to English, or to the current feed with all=20
languages.

[0]: https://github.com/kyrias/bano

--=20
Sincerely,
  Johannes L=C3=B6thberg
